  "description": "The composite desktop package for OutWit.Shared.Secrets: references the Windows, macOS and Linux providers and exposes SecretStoreDesktop.ForCurrentPlatform(), so a cross-platform desktop application takes one reference and writes one line. Selecting among the operating-system providers by runtime platform is not silent degradation — on each desktop platform exactly one OS store is right, and all three protect the same way. Falling back to the File provider stays a deliberate, configured choice.",
